Writer: read Word EQ field commands as StarMath

A parser for Word EQ field commands: \f fraction, \r radical,
\s super- and subscript, \b brackets, \l list, \a array,
\i integral, sum and product; \x and \o keep their content
without the box or overlay, \d moves forward only; \ai and
\di only space lines. Switches ignore case, as Word reads them.
Each command character keeps its vertAlign; one script stays one
script across style changes. Italic letters become identifiers,
which StarMath and OMML both draw italic. The next patch uses it.

